==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{es-IPA}}
* {{hyph|es|me|dio}}

===Etymology 1===
Probably partly borrowed from {{der|es|la|medius}} as a semi-learned form or modified from an existing inherited early {{cog|osp|-}} equivalent, presumably {{m|osp||*meo}} or {{m|osp||*meyo}}, to be closer to the Latin origin (possibly in order to avoid a phonetic similarity with the vulgar verb {{m|es|mear|t=to piss}}).<ref>https://www.scribd.com/document/158436269/Diccionario-Critico-Etimologico-castellano-MI-RI-Corominas-Joan-pdf</ref><ref>https://www.scribd.com/document/220768067/Corominas-Diccionario-Etimologico</ref> Compare {{cog|pt|meio}}, which retained its original inherited form. The sense of "medium" is taken from {{cog|la|medium}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|medium}}.

====Adjective====
{{es-adj|f=media}}

# [[half]], half a/an
#: {{uxi|es|'''media''' hora|'''half an''' hour}}
#: {{uxi|es|'''media''' manzana|'''half an''' apple}}
# [[middle]], [[mid]]
#: {{uxi|es|clase '''media'''|'''middle''' class}}
# [[mid]], in the middle of
# [[mean]], [[average]]
#: {{uxi|es|velocidad '''media'''|'''average''' speed}}
# a bit of a, somewhat of a
#: {{ux|es|Es '''medio''' idiota.|He’s '''a bit of an''' idiot.}}
# {{lb|es|Chile|intensifier|used before a noun}} very [[big]], very [[large]]
#: {{ux|es|¡'''Media''' bolsa!.|Such a big bag!.}}
# {{lb|es|Chile|intensifier|used before a noun}} very [[good]]

====Noun====
{{es-noun|m}}

# [[middle]], [[center]]
#: {{uxi|es|Alemania está en '''medio''' de Europa.|Germany is in the '''middle''' of Europe.}}
#: {{uxi|es|Se despertó en '''medio''' de la noche.|She awoke in the '''middle''' of the night.}}
#: {{uxi|es|en '''medio''' de la nada|in the '''middle''' of nowhere}}
# [[half]]
# {{lb|es|spiritualism}} [[medium]] 
#: {{syn|es|médium}}
# [[method]], [[way]]
# {{lb|es|in the plural}} [[means]]
#: {{uxi|es|Se mejoraron los '''medios''' de transporte.|'''Means''' of transport were improved.}}
#: {{uxi|es|El fin justifica los '''medios'''.|The end justifies the '''means'''.}}
# [[channel]], [[vehicle]], [[medium]]
#: {{uxi|es|¿Cuál es tu '''medio''' de pintura favorito?|What's your favorite painting '''medium'''?}}
# {{lb|es|in the plural}} [[media]]
#: {{uxi|es|los '''medios''' de masas|the mass '''media'''}}
#: {{ux|es|Los '''medios''' exageraron todo el asunto.|The '''media''' blew the whole thing out of proportion.}}
# {{lb|es|in the plural}} [[resources]], [[funds]], [[means]]
#: {{syn|es|recurso}}
# [[environment]], [[surroundings]], [[medium]], [[milieu]]
#: {{syn|es|medio ambiente}}
# [[society]]
# [[habitat]]
# {{lb|es|football}} [[halfback]]
# middle [[course]]
# {{lb|es|Mexico|historical|numatics}} {{l|en|medio}} {{gloss|an ancient coin}}
# {{lb|es|Peru|Cuba}} [[five]] [[cent]]s

====Adverb====
